+        2. Use save_note to record key findings from each search.
+        3. Use read_notes to review everything you have collected.
+        4. Produce a final summary with sections: Overview, Key Findings, and Sources.
+        Be thorough — search at least twice with varied queries before summarizing.
+        """,
+};
